{
  "name": "Real Estate AI WhatsApp Lead & Voice Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CLIENT SETUP — REAL ESTATE AI WHATSAPP + LEAD + VOICE\n\n### Required\n1. Connect WhatsApp Business Cloud credentials.\n2. Connect Groq credentials for both LLM nodes.\n3. Create one Google Spreadsheet with:\n   - `Properties`: Location | Type | Bedrooms | Price | Status\n   - `Brokers`: Name | Phone | Areas | Email (optional)\n   - `Leads`: Timestamp | Customer_Name | Customer_Phone | Message | Property_Type | Budget_Range | Preferred_Location | Urgency | Lead_Summary | Assigned_Broker | Broker_Phone | Status | Call_Recording_URL | Call_Summary\n4. Set environment variables:\n   - `WA_PHONE_NUMBER_ID`\n   - `PROPERTIES_SHEET_ID`\n   - `BROKERS_SHEET_ID`\n   - `LEADS_SHEET_ID`\n   - `LIVEKIT_SERVER_URL`\n   - `LIVEKIT_TOKEN_SERVER_URL`\n   - Optional: `GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK`\n5. Connect LiveKit HTTP authentication.\n6. Deploy a secure LiveKit token service. Do NOT store the LiveKit API secret in this workflow.\n7. Deploy the LiveKit Voice AI Agent and configure it to POST the call-end payload to `Webhook • Voice Call Summary`.\n8. Test the WhatsApp path, lead assignment path, and voice-call path before activation.\n\n### Important\nKeep this workflow inactive while configuring it. Use test credentials/data first.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2832,
        1664
      ],
      "id": "2102fd0f-46dd-4c36-a973-797e028d2a10",
      "name": "01 • Client Setup Guide"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VOICE CALL MODULE\n\nCustomer requests a voice call →\nLiveKit room → customer token → WhatsApp join link → LiveKit AI agent.\n\nThe Voice AI Agent should answer real-estate questions using the same business rules as the WhatsApp agent and POST a call-end summary containing:\n`room_name, customer_phone, duration_seconds, transcript, call_summary, recording_url, property_type, budget_range, preferred_location, urgency`",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4432,
        1664
      ],
      "id": "44255169-29b0-4da2-bf66-edbe664a24ce",
      "name": "02 • Voice Call Setup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## POST-CALL SUMMARY\n\nThe LiveKit agent sends the call-end payload here.\nThe workflow immediately returns HTTP 200, then parses the payload, updates the matching lead by `Customer_Phone`, and sends a WhatsApp follow-up summary.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        6432,
        1664
      ],
      "id": "3fbed4af-7a11-4f6b-9126-c3bb804c5afa",
      "name": "03 • Call Summary Setup"
    },
