        "textBody": "=📞 *AI Voice Call Ready!*\n\nNamaste {{ $('Core • Extract Customer Message').item.json.customer_name }}! 🏠\n\nHumara AI real estate agent aapka intezaar kar raha hai. Neeche diye gaye link pe click karke call join karein:\n\n🔗 {{ $json.join_url }}\n\n*Instructions:*\n• Microphone permission allow karein\n• Headphones use karein for better experience\n• Link 5 minutes mein expire ho jaayega\n\nAI agent aapki sabhi property queries answer karega — budget, location, availability sab kuch! 🏡",
        "additionalFields": {}
